<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-J LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-J LEAGUE RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of weekend soccer matches in</p>
<p>Japan's J League:</p>
<p> Kashiwa     3   Hiroshima   0</p>
<p> Urawa	 0   Kashima     0 (Kashima won 5-4 on penalties)</p>
<p> Yokohama M  1   Yokohama F  2</p>
<p> Hiratsuka   0   Kyoto	 1</p>
<p> Iwata	 3   Osaka C     0</p>
<p> Nagoya	1   Ichihara    1 (Nagoya won 4-2 on penalties)</p>
<p> Osaka G     1   Kawasaki    3</p>
